{"3723430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cafe Crew Simulator: Prologue", "steam_appid": 3723430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Cafe Crew Simulator: Prologue — a standalone introduction to the world of coffee, chaos, and competition. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this free prologue, you’ll experience the first days of running your café, learning the basics of crafting drinks, managing your space, and dealing with... unexpected interference. Because in this café business — you're not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723430/extras/f15913b0c5cf6066c64d211d8a9f249c.avif?t=1779184487\" width=1024 height=66 /></span>This is not just a demo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s your first step into a competitive café world — where every action matters, and every decision shapes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your future business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723430/extras/5dafc9a202a9f48336476a1606e4b098.avif?t=1779184487\" width=1024 height=66 /></span>Run Your First Café </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make espresso, latte, americano and more </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your café clean and running </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers fast — or lose them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Solo or With Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723430/extras/31aaad4b6bd39aa29c1048b3713312f3.poster.avif?t=1779184487\" width=1024 height=